			"version": 194,
			"versionNonce": 703620905,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1787583658399,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "When pinged it first gets IP then in return we get\nICMP Packets with time",
			"rawText": "When pinged it first gets IP then in return we get\nICMP Packets with time",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "When pinged it first gets IP then in return we get\nICMP Packets with time",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "YskOZwhM",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -276.2297058105469,
			"y": 333.5999755859375,
			"width": 866.859375,
			"height": 75,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1971c2",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "a6",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1045978150,
			"version": 329,
			"versionNonce": 1334176186,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1785675057596,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "First from our network a ICMP packet goes to the given IP then in return we get a IP \npacket from that network and the time in between the trips is called round trip time.\nICMP Seq -> Sequence of Packet",
			"rawText": "First from our network a ICMP packet goes to the given IP then in return we get a IP \npacket from that network and the time in between the trips is called round trip time.\nICMP Seq -> Sequence of Packet",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "First from our network a ICMP packet goes to the given IP then in return we get a IP \npacket from that network and the time in between the trips is called round trip time.\nICMP Seq -> Sequence of Packet",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "frWLp1SX",
