			"locked": false,
			"text": "-> It starts sending message with TTL=1 and keeps on incrementing the TTL till it reaches to destination IP Address.\n-> In this way we get all the IP addresses between the source and the Destination IP address.\n-> So traceroute uses ICMP along with TTL to trace the path\n-> *** in traceroute, as some router has ICMP disabled so these router drop the message but don't send the error reply.",
